  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa Onlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nG\xF6rd\xFC\u011F\xFCm
    kadar\u0131yla birtak\u0131m nedenlerden dolay\u0131 huzurun ka\xE7m\u0131\u015F.
    Her \u015Feyi yoluna koydu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrken, i\u015Fleyi\u015F
    kendili\u011Finden bozulma emareleri g\xF6stermi\u015F. Kart\u0131n, ruh dengeni
    sa\u011Flayan \xE7ivilerden baz\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131n s\xF6k\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    ve y\u0131k\u0131lmaktan korkmaya ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 i\u015Faret
    ediyor. \u0130stedi\u011Fin gibi gitmeyen \u015Feyler oldu\u011Funu d\xFC\u015F\xFCnmeye
    dayanamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Kontrol kayb\u0131 hissi, zamanlamalar\u0131n
    konusunda da senkronizasyonunu bozmu\u015F {{isim}}. Gecikmeler ve zaman\u0131nda
    atmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n ad\u0131mlar, seni baz\u0131 \u015Feylerin iptal olmas\u0131n\u0131n
    e\u015Fi\u011Finden d\xF6nd\xFCrm\xFC\u015F. \xD6nem verdi\u011Fin konularda
    i\u015Fleri zar zor toparlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
